{"id":"n13975-1-9","stage":2,"title":"연구실 · 研究室","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13975-1-9-1","ko":"박 교수님 연구실이 어딘지 아니?","zh":"你知道朴教授的研究室在哪里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"교수님","meaning":"教授","explanation":"교수：教授；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"교수","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31684","senseId":"2","lemma":"교수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연구실이","meaning":"研究室","explanation":"연구실：研究室；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연구실","audio":"/audio/5567549134629161ae86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13975","senseId":"1","lemma":"연구실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어딘지","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니?","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d57c92d078bf33a","term":"교수","zh":"教授","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3","entryId":"31684","definition":"在大学里研究学问并讲授课程的人；或指其职位。","pronunciation":["교ː수"]},{"id":"5567549134629161","term":"연구실","zh":"研究室","audio":"/audio/5567549134629161ae86.mp3","entryId":"13975","definition":"为专门做研究而被使用的房间。","pronunciation":["연ː구실"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，